{"reviews":[{"id":"B01J64H5TY-0","r":2.0,"t":"Not as advertised","x":"Please look at the photos attached and tell me how this is the same wig in the advertised photo?? It\u2019s sloppy and the buns are just super loose pony tails. Nothing like what I was expecting.","h":27,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-1","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Excellent! I fluffed it and it looks amazing. Perfect for Winifred Sanderson!","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-2","r":3.0,"t":"Not what i expected for $23 sorry","x":"Not what i expected for $23 lol. I tried fluffing this up but this was the best i could do. I mean if it was like 7 bux, i wouldnt care but this cost me 23 something and its definitely not worth it. Im giving it 3 stars tho cause if u want to do an IT costume or flip this wig around and be chucky itll be perfect for that hahaha","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-3","r":5.0,"t":"High quality & adjustable!","x":"I am thoroughly pleased with this wig! For the price, I expected a typical one size, one use, itchy wig that you can buy in any party or seasonal Halloween store. Pleasantly surprised! This wig is well made & the head size is adjustable. Plus, it came with a head cap. Fantastic deal for the product. I bought this for a Queen of Hearts costume after being disappointed in other \u201chat style\u201d Red Queen wigs available for Prime. This will be perfect for many other Halloween costumes & cos play. Im goi","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great Wig!","x":"This was a fabulous wig.  It came with the stocking to hold your natural hair down.  My hair is extremely thick and it held it down and I didn't have any problem with the wig staying on or in place.  I shook the wig out and poofed it a bit for the look I was going for.  It was fantastic.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-5","r":3.0,"t":"We tried to make this wig work for a Winifred ...","x":"We tried to make this wig work for a Winifred Sanderson costume and it was just too thin with very little volume..especially in the back.  Since it's not advertised as such I am giving it an OK rating, but I'm not too sure it would work for her either.  For the Sanderson costume we ended up going with a different wig from the costume shop that was specifically marketed as such made by Disney and priced cheaper than this one that really worked out well.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-6","r":3.0,"t":"Meh","x":"It is a well made wig however it certainly doesn't look as full as the picture would lead you to believe. I don't know how to fluff it to give it the look I was going for as the Queen of Hearts so hopefully the costume, make up and crown will deflect from the wig's shortcomings.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-7","r":5.0,"t":"The Red Queen Lives","x":"I received this wig and it was exactly like the picture, only flatter. I took it apart and revamped it so that it had more height. It worked well.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-8","r":2.0,"t":"Cheap looking","x":"The color or good but it is super cheap looking and no amount of styling would make it look better.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-9","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth it","x":"I was excited to be dressing up for Halloween this year.  My costume, the queen of hearts, depends on a good wig,  however this is not the one. This was my first choice after looking at all other choices. I\u2019m sorry I chose this. Does not fit the whole head, probably best fit for petite or children  and the material was sloppy put together and cheap.  I returned it and purchased another on Amazon which happened to be my last choice and ended up being the best looking one","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-10","r":5.0,"t":"If you're going to be the Queen of Hearts - go all out!","x":"Oh My Stars!  This wig is the best.  I bought the Queen of Hearts dress and topped it off with this crazy wig.  It's lightweight and comfortable AND STAYS PUT!  Was able to  easy secure a crown to the top, too.  I mean...c'mon.  I was QUEEN!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great wig for the price!","x":"Great wig! I got several compliments on the quality of the wig. Plus, I\u2019m a busy teacher and I didn\u2019t have to readjust it all day!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-12","r":3.0,"t":"Wig was okay.","x":"This wig was very hard to wear. It kept sliding around, even with the clips attached.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-13","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality.","x":"I got alot of compliments on this wig. Worked well with my costume.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-14","r":4.0,"t":"Pretty decent","x":"pretty good value, fit was a bit tough but I have very long hair","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great Priced Hair","x":"I was very pleased to get this item!  It was exactly what was needed to complete my Queen of Hearts costume.  The wig is very well made and did not even require a hair net to stay in place.  The only work required is to \u201cpick\u201d out the curls to make the heart shape look.  It was comfortable to wear & looked great in the photos!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-16","r":5.0,"t":"Love it! I am only going to give it ...","x":"Love it!  I am only going to give it four stars for now as we haven't used it for our show yet.  I will wait and see how well it holds up during performances to see if I would give it a five. Update: it was great and held up beautifully! It looked fantastic on stage and up close. Five stars!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-17","r":4.0,"t":"Nice wig","x":"I bought this for a Halloween costume. It comes with a hair cap and appears to be adjustable on the inside of the wig. I tried it on and it fits pretty well. Can't wait for the party. It feels soft also. Pretty nice for a costume wig for the price.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-18","r":5.0,"t":"Good quality","x":"This was very cute. I was impressed with the quality and it was already styled and easy to \u2018fluff\u2019 the curls into place. Better than expected.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-19","r":5.0,"t":"After a little teasing, it was perfect!","x":"[[VIDEOID:dc7b725241f5433e326e3339e61429b2]] This wig turned out perfect!  Happy Halloween \ud83d\udcab","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-20","r":5.0,"t":"Queen of Hearts","x":"Have a good time we're in the wig the children thought it was my real hair I had a good time","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-21","r":5.0,"t":"Queen of Hearts","x":"Perfect for my Queen of Hearts costume. Needed a little time to decompress for packaging.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-22","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"Really awesome quality for the price! Great for queen of hearts costume","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-23","r":3.0,"t":"I was unable to get each side to poof up like the pic","x":"Kind of goofy.  I was unable to get each side to poof up like the pic.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01J64H5TY-24","r":3.0,"t":"Not true red","x":"Was told this was a true red,.. it\u2019s not. Very orange tone.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers are pleased with the wig's quality and value for the price, calling it well made and a great deal.","cites":[4,5,11,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the wig looks flatter or thinner than the advertised photo and requires fluffing or styling to achieve the intended look.","cites":[1,6,7,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the wig cheap-looking or not worth the price.","cites":[3,9,10]},{"text":"A few reviewers report fit or staying-put issues, including sliding around or not fitting the whole head.","cites":[10,13,15]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers mention the wig stays put and is comfortable, with some noting it came with a head cap or stocking.","cites":[4,5,11,12]}]},"qa":[]}